      · simp only [wp_norm]; assumption
      · simp only [wp_norm]; assumption
      · rw [State.spAligned] at hsp_align ⊢; simp only [wp_norm]; exact hsp_align
      · simp only [wp_norm]; assumption
      · simp only [wp_norm]; assumption
      · simp only [wp_norm]; assumption
      · simp only [wp_norm]; assumption
      · simp only [wp_norm]; assumption
      · simp only [wp_norm]; assumption
      · simp only [wp_norm]; rfl
      · simp only [wp_norm]
